   ```
   This guarantees `world.camera` is set to a non-null `Camera` instance as part of normal `Game.init(...)` execution.

2. It can later be changed (including set to null) via:
   ```java
   public void setCamera(final ICamera cam) {
     if (this.camera() != null) {
       Game.loop().detach(camera);
     }

     camera = cam;

     if (cam != null && !Game.isInNoGUIMode()) {
